plying skins to gear.", "created_date": 1795173871, "id": "27499647303066517", "version": "1.7.5.0", "version_code": 342, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27499643499733564"}, "asset_files": {"count": 24}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27499647303066517"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795157764, "id": "27497435713287676", "version": "1.7.5.0", "version_code": 341, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27497433289954585"}, "asset_files": {"count": 24}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27499647303066517"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "247209914665124"}]}, "change_log": "v.1.7.4.1", "created_date": 1794894048, "id": "27456074150757166", "version": "1.7.4.1", "version_code": 340, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27456071104090804"}, "asset_files": {"count": 24}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27499647303066517"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "247209914665124"}]}, "change_log": "Patch Notes v1.7.4.0\n\nFixed an issue in PvE co-op where players remained in the raid after the extraction countdown ended, affecting Found in Raid item status and quest progress tracking.\nFixed trader levels incorrectly displaying as level 1 after login and only refreshing after playing a raid.\nFixed purchased ammunition disappearing from trader counters after just over 10 seconds.\nFixed issues causing balance and inventory data to load incorrectly or fail to load.\nFixed Brazilian Portuguese and Russian language settings not taking effect.\nFixed lingering Vivox callbacks accessing invalid objects after the voice module shut down, potentially causing errors or crashes.\nCorrected reference retention and release logic for Experience assets to reduce lifecycle-related crash risks.\nPatched the engine\u2019s LateUpdate logic to improve runtime stability.", "created_date": 1794571023, "id": "27405396582491590", "version": "1.7.4.0", "version_code": 339, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27405392692491979"}, "asset_files": {"count": 24}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27499647303066517"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "247209914665124"}]}, "change_log": "v.1.7.3.1", "created_date": 1793429889, "id": "27224273887270528", "version": "1.7.3.1", "version_code": 338, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27